// PREVIEW (branch preview/call-screen): pieces every call screen direction shares (call_looks.slint): the caption
// that crossfades line to line, the transcript and the reply field that grow out of their buttons, the caller on
// its record, and the record's lights.
import { T, Icon, Icons, Spoken, Morph } from "parts.slint";
import { Call } from "call_data.slint";

// The transcript (out of the Captions button) and the reply field (out of the Type button), over the whole screen.
export component Sheets inherits Rectangle {
    in property <length> caps-x; // the buttons' top left corners, and their size
    in property <length> caps-y;
    in property <length> type-x;
    in property <length> type-y;
    in property <length> fsize: 58px;
    in property <length> caps-size: self.fsize; // the Captions button, if not the same size
    in property <length> keep: 268px; // room the transcript leaves at the bottom (the controls)
    in property <length> lift: 188px; // how high the reply field sits over the bottom edge without a keyboard
    in property <color> panel: #1c1d21;
    property <bool> in-call: Call.phase != "incoming";
    // Pull down on the Transcript's header to close it, as a chat closes (chats/thread.slint): it follows the finger;
    // past 30% of its height, or a quick flick down, it closes into its button from where it was let go; less springs
    // back.
    property <length> pull;
    property <bool> held;
    property <length> from-y;
    property <length> last-y;
    property <duration> last-t;
    property <float> speed; // px per ms, downwards
    animate pull {
        duration: root.held ? 0ms : Call.caps-open ? 460ms : 300ms;
        easing: Call.caps-open ? cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.9, 0.24, 1) : T.close;
    }
    // dy: the finger's travel as the swipe handler sees it, inside the moving transcript
    function drag(local-dy: length) {
        let dy = local-dy + root.pull;
        if (!root.held) {
            root.held = true;
            root.from-y = dy; // where the swipe was seen to begin: it moves from there, no jump
            root.last-y = dy;
            root.last-t = animation-tick();
            root.speed = 0;
            return;
        }
        let t = animation-tick();
        if (t - root.last-t >= 8ms) {
            root.speed = (dy - root.last-y) / 1px / ((t - root.last-t) / 1ms);
            root.last-y = dy;
            root.last-t = t;
        }
        root.pull = max(0px, dy - root.from-y);
    }
    function let-go(may-close: bool) {
        if (!root.held) { return; }
        let v = animation-tick() - root.last-t < 100ms ? root.speed : 0; // a finger held still has no speed left
        let close = may-close && root.pull > 0px && (v > 0.9 || (root.pull > caps.height * 0.3 && v > -0.5));
        root.held = false;
        if (close) { Call.caps-open = false; }
        root.pull = 0px;
    }
    Rectangle {
        y: root.pull;
        caps := Morph {
            open: Call.caps-open && root.in-call;
            fx: root.caps-x;
            fy: root.caps-y;
            fsize: root.caps-size;
            tx: 12px;
            ty: Call.sat + 8px;
            tw: root.width - 24px;
            th: root.height - Call.sat - 8px - Call.sab - root.keep;
            face: Icons.captions;
            panel: root.panel;
            VerticalLayout {
                SwipeGestureHandler {
                    height: 60px;
                    handle-swipe-down: true;
                    moved => { if (self.swiping) { root.drag(self.current-position.y - self.pressed-position.y); } }
                    swiped => { root.let-go(true); }
                    cancelled => { root.let-go(false); }
                    Text { x: 20px; text: "Transcript"; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: T.fg; vertical-alignment: center; height: parent.height; }
                    Rectangle {
                        x: parent.width - 54px;
                        y: 6px;
                        width: 48px;
                        height: 48px;
                        Icon { d: Icons.close; x: 12px; y: 12px; }
                        TouchArea { clicked => { Call.caps-open = false; } }
                    }
                    Rectangle { y: parent.height - 1px; height: 1px; background: #2a2c31; }
                }
                Flickable {
                    content-height: rows.preferred-height;
                    content-y: Math.min(0px, self.height - rows.preferred-height);
                    rows := VerticalLayout {
                        width: root.width - 24px;
                        padding: 16px;
                        spacing: 12px;
                        for m in Call.msgs: HorizontalLayout {
                            alignment: m.me ? end : start;
                            Rectangle {
                                max-width: (root.width - 56px) * 0.8;
                                background: m.me ? T.me : #202227;
                                border-top-left-radius: 20px;
                                border-top-right-radius: 20px;
                                border-bottom-left-radius: m.me ? 20px : 6px;
                                border-bottom-right-radius: m.me ? 6px : 20px;
                                VerticalLayout {
                                    padding-left: 14px;
                                    padding-right: 14px;
                                    padding-top: 10px;
                                    padding-bottom: 10px;
                                    Spoken { text: m.text; lit: m.lit; lit-color: m.me ? white : T.fg; }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
    // The reply field: one line sits in the middle of 64px; more grow it upwards a line at a time, up to six, then
    // the text scrolls inside (the chat's field, chats/field.slint). Enter starts a new line; Send sends.
    probe := Text { visible: false; text: "Ag"; font-size: 17px; }
    property <length> line: probe.preferred-height;
    property <length> pad: (64px - root.line) / 2;
    property <length> area: max(64px, min(input.preferred-height, 6 * root.line) + 2 * root.pad);
    animate area { duration: 300ms; easing: T.out; }
    changed area => { Call.field-h = self.area; }
    Morph {
        open: Call.typing && root.in-call && Call.phase != "ended";
        fx: root.type-x;
        fy: root.type-y;
        fsize: root.fsize;
        tx: 16px;
        ty: root.height - Call.kb - max(12px, Call.sab + root.lift - Call.kb) - root.area; // 12px above the keyboard
        tw: root.width - 32px;
        th: root.area;
        radius: 32px;
        face: Icons.keyboard;
        panel: root.panel;
        HorizontalLayout {
            padding-left: 20px;
            padding-right: 8px;
            spacing: 4px;
            alignment: stretch;
            window := Rectangle {
                horizontal-stretch: 1;
                min-width: 0px;
                preferred-width: 0px;
                clip: true;
                property <length> scroll: 0px;
                Rectangle {
                    y: root.pad;
                    height: parent.height - 2 * root.pad;
                    clip: true;
                    input := TextInput {
                        // fits: at the foot of the box (as it grows the lines rise from it); longer: scrolled to the caret
                        y: max(parent.height - self.height, min(0px, window.scroll));
                        width: parent.width;
                        height: max(root.line, self.preferred-height);
                        text <=> Call.draft;
                        font-size: 17px;
                        color: T.fg;
                        single-line: false;
                        wrap: word-wrap;
                        cursor-position-changed(at) => {
                            if (at.y + window.scroll < 0px) {
                                window.scroll = -at.y;
                            } else if (at.y + root.line + window.scroll > parent.height) {
                                window.scroll = parent.height - root.line - at.y;
                            }
                        }
                    }
                    Text {
                        y: parent.height - self.height;
                        width: parent.width;
                        height: root.line;
                        visible: Call.draft == "" && input.preedit-text == "";
                        text: "Type a reply";
                        font-size: 17px;
                        color: #8c8f97;
                        vertical-alignment: center;
                    }
                }
            }
            Rectangle {
                width: 48px;
                Rectangle {
                    y: parent.height - 56px;
                    height: 48px;
                    border-radius: 24px;
                    property <bool> any: Call.draft != "" || input.preedit-text != "";
                    background: self.any ? T.accent : transparent;
                    animate background { duration: 200ms; easing: T.out; }
                    Icon { d: Icons.send; x: 12px; y: 12px; stroke: parent.any ? white : T.muted; }
                    TouchArea {
                        enabled: parent.any;
                        clicked => {
                            Call.send(Call.draft, input.preedit-text, input.cursor-position-byte-offset);
                            Call.draft = "";
                            Call.clear-field();
                            Call.typing = false;
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            Rectangle {
                width: 48px;
                Rectangle {
                    y: parent.height - 56px;
                    height: 48px;
                    Icon { d: Icons.close; x: 12px; y: 12px; }
                    TouchArea { clicked => { Call.typing = false; } }
                }
            }
        }
    }
    focusSoon := Timer { interval: 220ms; running: false; triggered => { self.running = false; if (Call.typing) { input.focus(); } } }
    property <bool> typing: Call.typing;
    changed typing => { if (self.typing) { focusSoon.running = true; } else { input.clear-focus(); } }
}
